      "side": 1,
      "message": "this was proposed here: https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/netconf/+/124022/comment/27b457e8_6c5105d0/\n\nand removed from switch, since QUIC isn\u0027t the same kind of transport option (it doesn\u0027t go through AUTH_PROVIDER_FACTORY/transformUnderlay like tcp/tls)",
